---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /logs/
title: Logs
containerClass: narrow
---

<header class="page-header">
    <h1>Logs</h1>
    <p>
        A rather free collection of writings about technology, lifestyle, music,
        and whatnot. None of the text here is AI generated.
    </p>
</header>

